# The header of hdrcases/sip4_no_apbp (TAN-SIP order 4, no AP/BP), handed
# to wcslib exactly as written (NOINJECT). wcslib 8.10 sipset REFUSES it:
# with no AP_p_q / BP_p_q card the inverse degree is -1. It cannot read a
# SIP header without an inverse polynomial at all, although disx2p inverts
# A/B by iteration and uses AP/BP only as the starting guess. We accept
# the header and invert A/B by Newton iteration; the answer must equal the
# golden of sip4_no_apbp, which is wcslib's iterated inverse started from
# an identity AP/BP (the harness injection, see hdr2sky.c CAVEAT).
# EXPECT-WCSLIB-ERROR: Degree must not exceed 9, got -1
# SAME-AS: sip4_no_apbp
NOTE lenient: sip_no_apbp
NOINJECT
GRID 1 4096 9 1 4096 9
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 4096
NAXIS2  = 4096
CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN-SIP'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN-SIP'
CRVAL1  = 150.1166
CRVAL2  = 2.2058
CRPIX1  = 2048.0
CRPIX2  = 2048.0
CD1_1   = -1.3888E-05
CD1_2   = 2.1E-07
CD2_1   = 1.9E-07
CD2_2   = 1.3888E-05
A_ORDER = 4
A_0_2   = 2.1E-06
A_1_1   = -1.4E-05
A_2_0   = 8.2E-06
A_0_3   = 3.1E-10
A_1_2   = -2.2E-10
A_2_1   = 5.1E-10
A_3_0   = -1.3E-10
A_0_4   = 1.1E-14
A_2_2   = -3.0E-14
A_4_0   = 2.0E-14
B_ORDER = 4
B_0_2   = -6.0E-06
B_1_1   = 9.0E-06
B_2_0   = -2.6E-06
B_0_3   = 4.0E-10
B_1_2   = 1.9E-10
B_2_1   = -3.3E-10
B_3_0   = 2.2E-10
B_1_3   = 1.5E-14
B_3_1   = -2.5E-14
B_0_4   = 5.0E-15
